{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The ORDINARY run of a saved flow command (R5) - the shared entry point behind dev.code.trace_flow and the flow editor's Run. No debug session, tape, snapshots or debugger budget: the same gate as app.app.exec (library check, check_auth, nn_sessionid, cast_params), then flowlang's own stepper (flowlang::stepper::step_stack, the one semantics Command::execute runs) driven to the end on the default pick, observed only. Returns FLAT {status, result, path, cases, complete, outcome, end, steps, max_depth, budget, ms, us, [events, events_truncated, events_total]}. result is THE mapping: ok and terminate (a root terminate is success with the output delivered so far) go through app.app.exec's format_result; a failure is {status err, msg, flow_end: fail|stall|I-4|panic|depth|budget} (an ordinary invoke reports every such failure as a 500 unwrap-on-Err(Fail)). path is COMPLETE: one segment {case, end, op?, ms, us, steps} per ROOT case (nested frames never enter it), ended by next | done | terminate | fail | stall | I-4 | panic | budget; ms/us are monotonic wall time at this boundary, nested work attributed to the root case it ran under. events: 0 = record none, N > 0 = keep the first N (events_truncated flags the rest; never affects result or path), < 0 = keep all. budget: 0 = 1,000,000 steps (the same cap Command::execute runs under), N > 0 = N steps, < 0 = unlimited; running out is an explicit error (flow_end budget, budget_exhausted true), never a truncated success. nn_sessionid is filled in by the framework (pass \"\" from javascript). Admin-only.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::command::Command;\nuse flowlang::stepper;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse std::panic;\nuse std::time::Instant;\nuse crate::app::service::init::format_result;\nuse crate::security::security::init::check_auth;","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"cmd","type":"String"},{"name":"args","type":"JSONObject"},{"name":"events","type":"Integer"},{"name":"budget","type":"Integer"},{"name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"zixhvt1a1921dffe4of5","readers":[],"time":1793453037775,"username":"system","writers":[]}